<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-LAT FIXING VS NON-CONVERTIBLE CURRENCIES.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-LAT FIXING VS NON-CONVERTIBLE CURRENCIES.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Wednesday set</p>
<p>the following rates for the lat versus non-convertible</p>
<p>currencies for the period July 14 to July 20.</p>
<p>    Belarus rouble 1000   0.0213</p>
<p>    Kazakh tenge 1000     7.62</p>
<p>    Azerbaijan manat 1000 0.144</p>
<p>    Uzbek sum		 0.0091</p>
<p>    Georgian lari	   0.459</p>
<p>    Armenian dram 1000    1.40</p>
<p>    Turkmen manat 1000    0.138</p>
<p>    Tajik rouble 1000     1.065</p>
<p>    Ukraine hryvnia	 0.310</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
